// After the Battle — yuddha kanda
// Source: Valmiki, Yuddha Kanda, sargas 109-113 (verify)
// Migrated from the old script format. Not yet staged for the Ramlila stage.

>> scene battlefield style=kachni
>> music grief
>> cast ravana at 0.76 pose=dead face=left y=-60 mode=line
>> cast vibhishana at 0.6 pose=grieve mode=colour
>> cast rama:exile at 0.2 mode=colour
VIBHISHANA: He gave to everyone who asked. He kept his fires. He knew the Vedas to the last syllable. I told him, and told him. Now the lamp of our house is out.
>> enter mandodari from left to 0.06 in 0.8 colour=true
>> play walkTo \{"who":"mandodari","to":0.66,"speed":80,"hint":"after.2"\}
>> pose mandodari kneel
MANDODARI: You conquered your senses once, to win your boons. They have had their revenge. I asked you to send her back. I asked you every night.
She tries to lift his head into her lap. She cannot.
>> pose vibhishana stand
>> set vibhishana face=-1
VIBHISHANA: He stole another man's wife and broke every law. I do not know that I should perform his rites.
RAMA: Enmity ends with death. Our purpose is done. Do it, with every honour. He is mine to mourn now as much as he is yours.
>> scene lanka clear
>> enter vibhishana from left to 0.5 in 0.1 colour=true
>> enter lakshmana:exile from left to 0.34 in 0.1 colour=true
>> pose lakshmana give
>> sound bell
Rama, who may not enter a city until his exile ends, sends Lakshmana in to crown Vibhishana king of Lanka.
>> scene grove clear
>> prop tree shimshapa at 0.6 raw=true colour=true
>> enter sita:exile from right to 0.6 in 0.1 colour=true
>> enter hanuman from left to 0.36 in 1.2 colour=true
>> pose hanuman namaste
>> music home
HANUMAN: Rama is well, and Lakshmana. Ravana is dead. You can stop being afraid.
For a moment she cannot speak at all.
SITA: I have nothing to give you for this. There is nothing in the world I could give you for this.
-> END
